            whose models are precisely the models
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi N
                  %mo ⊧
                  %mi T
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N \models T
            into which
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi M
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} M
            embeds as a substructure and
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/elementary+embedding"} elementary substructure
          %p
            In the case of the latter, this gives a theory whose category of models is precisely the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/co-slice+category"} co-slice category
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi M
